### List angle presets for partner — happy path
GET http://localhost:7015/api/v1/partner/angle-preset?clientName=CLIENT_A HTTP/1.1
x-api-key: your-partner-api-key

### List angle presets — missing API key
GET http://localhost:7015/api/v1/partner/angle-preset?clientName=CLIENT_A HTTP/1.1

### List angle presets — invalid API key
GET http://localhost:7015/api/v1/partner/angle-preset?clientName=CLIENT_A HTTP/1.1
x-api-key: invalid-key

### List angle presets — missing clientName
GET http://localhost:7015/api/v1/partner/angle-preset HTTP/1.1
x-api-key: your-partner-api-key

### List angle presets — unknown client
GET http://localhost:7015/api/v1/partner/angle-preset?clientName=BETTY HTTP/1.1
